# P114 on macOS (AppKit and GTK): NavigationStack's back control is labelled with the title of the screen it returns to and says Back when that screen has no title.
# Every press is by text (taplabel). A back control with any other label is not found and the replay fails at that row.
# Pass: the replay reports replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3 2 1 0 1 2; the final capture shows the Untitled screen under a "‹ Fruits" back control.
# P114 在 macOS (AppKit and GTK) 上:返回控制項以要返回之畫面的標題命名，該畫面沒有標題時顯示 Back。每一次點擊都以文字進行(taplabel),標籤不對的返回控制項找不到，重放就在那一列失敗。
